  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\nThis release adds a telemetry API to report product state changes and tags traces with their OpenTelemetry Protocol export mode.\r\n\r\n### Functional Change\r\n\r\n* OpenTelemetry: Tag traces with OpenTelemetry Protocol export mode. #378\r\n* Telemetry: Add API to report product state changes. #383\r\n\r\n### Technical Change\r\n\r\n* Lint code with Clang Tidy. #372\r\n* Add detailed contribution guidelines. #386\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-cpp/compare/v2.3.0...v2.4.0"
